# Build-context exclusions.
#
# Without this file the whole repo root is uploaded to the Docker daemon, and
# `COPY client/ ./` in Dockerfile.client copied the build host's own
# node_modules straight over the `npm ci` tree created two lines earlier --
# silently discarding the lockfile-pinned install and resolving Vite and every
# plugin from whatever happened to be on the developer's machine.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage

# Secrets and local overrides must never enter the build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docker-compose.override.yml

# History and tooling: large, and nothing in a build needs them.
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
**/npm-debug.log*
**/*.md
!README.md
